	(text "Eaton NRMF105F3950B1F (100k NTC, B3950)\nR_NTC = 114.54 kOhms @ 22C\nR_NTC = 100.00 kOhms @ 25C\nR_NTC = 5.54 kOhms @ 105C\nV_ADC = 3.3 * (R_NTC / (R_FIXED + R_NTC))\n\nWith R_FIXED = 10 kOhms:\nat 22C: V_ADC = 3.035V\nat 25C: V_ADC = 3.000V\nat 105C: V_ADC = 1.176V"
